@startuml sequence-errors
title AdVerity review-ready ad pack — Refusal and reset flows
footer CONFIDENTIAL — Internal use only · (c) HARA Solutions Limited & HealthCrew.ai

actor Practitioner
participant "Ad Pack service" as API
participant "UrlGuard" as Guard
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Model adapter" as Model

== Flag off ==
Practitioner -> API: POST /api/packs
API --> Practitioner: unavailable, no fetch, no model, no insert

== Private or metadata URL ==
Practitioner -> API: POST /api/packs {url}
API -> Guard: resolve and classify
Guard --> API: refuse
API -> DB: pack needs_input, no body stored
API --> Practitioner: needs_input

== Model timeout or bad schema ==
API -> Model: draft
Model --> API: timeout or non-conforming JSON
API -> DB: status model_unavailable, no invented assets
API --> Practitioner: model_unavailable

== Validation failure ==
API -> API: google_count over 30 or 90
API -> DB: validation_passed false, full text kept
API --> Practitioner: draft preview, export refused

== Comment, then an edit ==
Practitioner -> API: POST comment
API -> DB: comment row, approvals unchanged
Practitioner -> API: POST revision (text, offer, locale, or destination)
API -> DB: new version, both approvals absent
API --> Practitioner: export_eligible false

== Approval without the required person ==
Practitioner -> API: POST approval as client before copy expert
API --> Practitioner: rejected, no approval row
Practitioner -> API: POST client approval with no assignee
API --> Practitioner: pending, no fabricated approver
@enduml
